a client without a jar forgets every cookie:
GET /login        -> Cookie header: (none)
GET /echo         -> Cookie header: (none)
a client with a jar:
GET /login        -> Cookie header: sid=abc123
GET /prefs/echo   -> Cookie header: theme=dark; sid=abc123
GET /echo         -> Cookie header: sid=abc123
in the jar: sid=abc123, HttpOnly=1, path /; 2 cookies
GET /logout       -> bye
GET /prefs/echo   -> Cookie header: theme=dark
in the jar: 1 cookie
